<h1>Construct_Point_Entity</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> &#160;Creates new datum point by a construction point reducible entity.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Parameters</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>Name</b></i></span>  name of the resulting datum point that will be created.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>Entity</b></i></span>  name of the construction point reducible entity. Could have entity of one of the following types:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Point  uses the point itself.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Line  uses first (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 1) or last (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 2) point from the line.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Plane  uses its centre point.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Circle  uses its centre.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Sphere  uses its centre.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Cylinder  uses first (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 1) or last (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 2) point from its axis.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Cone  uses its apex (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 1) or base centre (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 2).</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Rectangular slot  uses its centre (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 0), its first corner point (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 1), its second corner point (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 2), its third corner point (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 3), or its fourth corner point (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 4).</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Round slot  uses its centre (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 0), its first semicircle centre (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 1), or its second semicircle centre (if <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>PointIndex</i></span> = 2).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>PointIndex</b></i></span>  used only if the entity in <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Entity</i></span> parameter is line, cylinder, cone, rectangular slot, or round slot. The values are 1 or 2 for line, cylinder, cone, 0, 1, 2, 3, or 4 for rectangular slot and 0, 1, 2 for round slot. In all other cases this parameter is ignored. Default value is 0.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>UI Commands</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span><i style="font-style:italic;">Datuming &gt; Point (Interactive point definition</i> <span style="font-style:normal;">method</span><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>)</i></span></span> from the main menu or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Datuming &gt; Non-interactive &gt; Point (Sphere/Circle (From list)</i></span> tab<span style="font-style:italic;"><i>)</i></span> from the main menu.</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Example:</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Construct_Point_Entity( Name="Point 1", Entity="Circle 1", PointIndex=0 )</p>
